{"ok":true,"module":"io/output/d06","docs":{"io/output/d06/binding_port":{"type":"UInt16","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.binding_port.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.binding_port.help","enum_set":"flowio_binding_port_digital_output","label":"Sortie physique (relais)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.binding_port.label","help":"Relais physique piloté par cette fonction. « Non connecté » laisse la sortie inerte. Le changement est pris en compte au prochain démarrage.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.binding_port.help"},"io/output/d06/d06_active_high":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_active_high.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_active_high.help","label":"Actif à 1 D06","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_active_high.label","help":"Si vrai, D06 est active à l'état haut; sinon active-bas.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_active_high.help"},"io/output/d06/d06_initial_on":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_initial_on.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_initial_on.help","label":"État initial ON D06","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_initial_on.label","help":"État appliqué au démarrage pour la sortie D06.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_initial_on.help"},"io/output/d06/d06_momentary":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_momentary.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_momentary.help","label":"Mode impulsion D06","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_momentary.label","help":"Active un fonctionnement impulsionnel pour D06.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_momentary.help"},"io/output/d06/d06_name":{"type":"CharArray","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_name.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_name.help","label":"Nom sortie D06","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_name.label","help":"Nom lisible de la sortie digitale D06.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_name.help"},"io/output/d06/d06_pulse_ms":{"type":"Int32","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_pulse_ms.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_pulse_ms.help","unit":"ms","label":"Durée impulsion D06 (ms)","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_pulse_ms.label","help":"Durée de l'impulsion automatique de D06.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.d06_pulse_ms.help"},"io/output/d06/retain_on_warm_reboot":{"type":"Bool","label_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help_t":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.retain_on_warm_reboot.help","enum_set":"io_output_boot_behavior","label":"Comportement au reboot D06","label_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.retain_on_warm_reboot.label","help":"Choisit si D06 applique son état initial au démarrage ou conserve le latch matériel TCA9554 lors d'un reboot chaud de l'ESP32. Sur un démarrage électrique froid, les sorties restent forcées à OFF.","help_i18n":"cfgdocs.io.output.d06.retain_on_warm_reboot.help"}},"meta":{}}